# Ridge Run - modelling reference
# RHINO COORDINATES: Z is up, X is the direction the player runs,
# +Y is AWAY from the camera (game -Z).
# Units are game units; 1 unit ~ 1 metre. Model with the origin at the
# BOTTOM CENTRE of the footprint.

# sign: model INSIDE the NOMINAL box. Origin = bottom centre.

